+## Extension-specific numerals
+
+This section describes the independently maintained Fumen Language Support patch, not the published Fumen 1.3.3.
+
+The patch draws numerals with more than one digit, such as `(12/8)` and `(3/16)`, one glyph per digit; the shorter numeral is centred on the longer one.
+The published Fumen 1.3.3 fails to draw the whole score for them.
